    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i just feel like these rules are so arbitrary and clunky. it feels like trying to keep track of a bunch of tiny, annoying details that just serve to make the text harder to read. do you have any tips for just keeping them straight so i don't mess up my whole bibliography?",
